    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūbapīja bana Yabeeshi-gileadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu shikū jenījo Nahashi wa Amoni, ūkuminga ibità lya bashilikale bakwe ūūkagūgobanīla ū nzengo gwa Yabeshi-gileadi. A bagosha ba Yabeshi a bose būng'wīla, “Tūlaganage tūtūūle mhola a ha gatī yise nū bebe, a bise tūbize ha sīlīlī yako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Nahashi ūbawīla, “Nalī na mhayo gūmò, ūlū ng'ūgūzunya hū tūkūlagana tūtūūle mhola a ha gatī ying'we nū nene. Zunyagi būlī ūmò wing'we nankobole ī liso lya kū būlyo, nang'wītīle mhayo gwa kūbadiimya minala pye a Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banamhala ba Baisilaeli būng'wīla, “Naheene twinhage ikanza lya shikū mpungatī tūgūjinje ū mhayo gwenūyū ū mu Baisilaeli; ūlū atilongile ose ose wa kūtūguna, tūkwifunya ū kūlī bebe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakatūng'wa aho baashika ī Gibea ya ng'wa Saulo būbawīla a banhū ū mhayo go ng'wa Nahashi; bose pye būtandūka kūlīla ng'hūngū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Saulo nang'hwe ūsangwa alīshikīīla kūfuma kū malaale walī wakalīma; walī na nzīkū jakwe ja kūlīma. Ūbūūja, “Bīītaga kī a banhū? Nibūlī balīīlīla?” Būng'wīla ī mihayo īyo yalī yenhwa na banhū ba kūfuma Yabeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho wīyiigwa ī mihayo yenīyo, ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wizīīla na nguzu ningī no; ūbaka gete na būpelanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ūsola nzīkū ibīlī, ūjisīnza hama ūjibutagūla mapingili mapingili, hūna ūtūma banhū kūgasambaaja hose pyī ū mu Isilaeli, na kūhaya, “Būlī munhū ūyo atūūfuma kūja hamò na Saulo na Sang'weli, ī nzīkū jakwe jikwītwa gīko.” Lyogohya lya ng'wa SEEBA lyūbagwīla a banhū, biza pye mu būsangī bumò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikumingīla Bezeki; ū Saulo aho wababala bilonga bagosha shihūmbī magana adatū a ba kūfuma mu Isilaeli, a ba kūfuma mu Yuda bilonga shihūmbī makūmi adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būbawīla abo baalī baatūng'wa kūfuma Yabeshi, “Bawīlagi a banhū ba Yabeshi-gileadi gīkī, ‘Ī ntondo ī līīmi ūlū līlīshika mu makanza ga kūseba, mukūbiza ng'wagunanhagwa.’” Abo baalī baatūng'wa aho baajishisha ī mhola jenījo, a banhū ba Yabeshi būyega no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūkabawīla a bana Amoni, “Ntondo tūkwifunya ū kū bing'we mutwītīle gīt'ūmo mutogelilwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū lūshikū lwa ntondo yaho lwenūlo ū Saulo wipuuna dilū ītaalī būjikū, ūbagabanhya a banhū bakwe mu mabità adatū, hūna ng'wikanza lya ngoko ja kwandya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ikanza lya ngoko ja kwandya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lūdīīma kwa kūmalīja būjikū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūūkabadumīla a Baamoni ū mu ng'hambī yabo, ūbisanganīja wandya kūbasengagūla shū kūshisha līīmi lyūseba. Būsaagīīla bageehu, būsalang'hana kībi, būlī ng'wene lwakwe lwakwe; yūbiza shilambu kūbona babīlī balī hamò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kwanīlwa lwa kabīlī kūbiza ntemi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū būmūūja ū Sang'weli balīhaya, “Baanani ng'hana abo bahayaga gīkī, ‘Ū ng'wing'wana ng'wenūyū adūgije kūtūpīja gete!’ A banhū benabo benhagi aha tūbabūlage.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Saulo ūhaya gīkī “Atīho munhū nūūlū ūmò wa kūbūlagwa ī lelo, nguno ū SEEBA wabakomoolaga a Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli ūbawīla a banhū, “Tūjagi Giligaali tūkabūshikaanye ū būtemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana pye a banhū būja Giligaali, būūkanshikaanya kwenūko ū Saulo a ha būtemi, kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. Būfunya na shakwinha sha būsangī kū būtongi bo ng'wa Seeeba; ū Saulo na a Baisilaeli a bose būbeeja shigukulu shitaale no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
